{"articleNo":"150406","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=150406&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"순천시 청년 문화(음식)촌 참여 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.04.25","hit":"2151","attachments":[{"name":"청년 문화(음식)촌 입점자 모집 공고.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=150406&attachNo=75966"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">청년들의 창업을 통한 일자리 창출 및 관광객의 먹거리</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">볼거리</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">즐길거리를 제공하기 위해 순천시 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">청년 문화</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">음식</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">촌</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">」 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">입점자를 다음과 같이 모집하오니</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">사 업 명 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">:</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">청년 문화</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">음식</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">촌</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">입점자 모집 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">개인 또는 팀</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">응모자격 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 19</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">세 이상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">~ 34</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">세 이하 청년</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(1982.1.1. ~ 1997.12.31.) </span></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">모집분야 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">총 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">25</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">개</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">식</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">음료 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">15</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">개</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">공예디자인 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">개</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">라</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">접수기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: ‘16. 5. 6. ~ ‘16. 5. 13.(8</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">일간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/b2d37291-3b78-4f7c-92b5-8734e1e00503.jpg\" width=\"539\" height=\"671\"> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
